; DIMRADIUS on a circle: Esc after the pick, the location in the centre (not regenerable,
; PT24 point 2: the reason and the prompt again), Angle 30, then the location (PT27, #715).
; The point on the curve is in the direction of the location from the centre (PT27, point 2);
; text at the location, with bit 128 of group 70 as in autocad-quote.dxf (E1, F3).
CIRCLE
0,0
10
DIMRADIUS
10,0
; cambia con #930
!esc
DIMRADIUS
10,0
0,0
A
30
20,15
